---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Now | Marcus Schimizzi" description="What I'm focused on right now.">
    <div class="page now">
        <header class="page-header">
            <span class="section-num">Now</span>
            <h1 class="page-title">What I'm <em>up to.</em></h1>
            <p class="page-aside">Last updated: February 2026</p>
        </header>

        <p class="page-lead">
            This is a "now" page. If you have your own site, <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">you should make one too</a>.
        </p>

        <!-- Lately -->
        <section class="now-section">
            <span class="section-num">Lately</span>
            <div class="now-grid">
                <div class="now-card">
                    <p class="card-label">Reading</p>
                    <p class="card-body"><em>Jailbird</em> by Kurt Vonnegut</p>
                </div>
                <div class="now-card">
                    <p class="card-label">Tinkering with</p>
                    <p class="card-body">Memory systems for agentic AI — how to give agents persistent, useful context across sessions.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="now-card">
                    <p class="card-label">Watching</p>
                    <p class="card-body">Excited for Mariners and Pirates baseball season. Also watching my surprisingly good Penguins.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="now-card">
                    <p class="card-label">Cooking</p>
                    <p class="card-body">Working through recipes from <em>The Food Lab</em> by J. Kenji López-Alt.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="now-block">
            <span class="section-num">What I'm working on</span>
            <div class="block-body">
                <p>At work, I'm focused on building a fully automated LLM pipeline for real estate title searches and exams at Qualia.</p>
                <p>Side-project wise, I've been all over the map, but the main focus right now is <strong>Honeycomber</strong> — a career companion app. I'm also building <strong>Strata</strong>, a cousin of Obsidian with PARA structure, richer note types, and AI integration.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="now-block">
            <span class="section-num">What I'm into</span>
            <div class="block-body">
                <p>I've picked up squash recently, and once it gets warmer I intend to play more beach volleyball and pickleball. While it's winter, I'm mostly building side projects, reading, and planning my wedding.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .page {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 0 4rem;
    }
    .page-header {
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .section-num {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--gold);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .page-title {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 0.95;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    .page-title em {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--gold);
        letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .page-aside {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--ink-dim);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .page-lead {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: var(--ink-dim);
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0 0 3rem;
    }
    .page-lead a {
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
        padding-bottom: 1px;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .page-lead a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    .now-section {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .now-section .section-num { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .now-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 700px) {
        .now-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
    }
    .now-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .now-card:hover { border-color: rgba(230, 181, 74, 0.3); }
    .card-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }
    .card-body {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .card-body em {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 1.05em;
    }

    .now-block {
        margin-top: 4rem;
        padding-top: 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .now-block .section-num { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .block-body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--ink);
        max-width: 60ch;
    }
    .block-body strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
</style>
